Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 06:25:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] UPDATE command-surface slash prompts so selected-agent
 commands reach the active chat

The controller records the selected agent and intercepts slash command tokens before they enter the command-agent transcript. The terminal adapter activates the visible or remembered target chat before sending, so command-surface /status prompts display with the agent response instead of the command-agent view.
